{"title":"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samantha receives the following marks out of 100 in seven of her eight courses:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before she finds out her actual French mark, Samantha calculates the highest possible average that she could obtain in all eight courses. Determine this average.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of her marks was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b8611fb16f20726f07e4347a2929faa0fff68f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$588$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c582b067d920d8dede3bdb0b76c95ee73271344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84 \\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> (from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">part a</a>). \n</p><p>Since the marks are out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, the highest possible mark would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so her total would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52edba6649fa33f660f45c102d7f8f06fd792f1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$588 + 100 = 688$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> at most. The average would then be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/800a8468820ca73a2854e411c697ae8b952a5e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{688}{8} = \\boxed{86}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 34/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 843/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1055/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.485      1 2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   12.485      1 -total\n 43.84%    5.473      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36622:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211532 and revision id 282473. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}